# 📦 CAPSULE — COGAs Platform (Final, All Phases)
CAPSULE — COGAs Consultancy Platform
Project: COGAs Consultancy Web Application — All-in-One Business Operating System
Current Phase: Phase 1 COMPLETE + Architecture for Phases 2–6 SHIPPED
Status: Production-ready skeleton with all UI, flows and data models live.
External integrations stubbed behind feature flags — flip on when
credentials are ready.

Vision (final, clarified):
COGAs is a family-run agri-consultancy. The platform is an internal, AI-powered,
all-in-one operating system to run the business professionally and automated.
Inspired by OptiCore's 18 products but not selling them. OptiCore is a separate
business (productized SME systems to sell later). The COGAs platform has 8 modules:

Client & Sales 5. Communications

Project Delivery 6. Knowledge & AI (AgriMind)

Money & Finance 7. Operations & Compliance

Team & People 8. Insights & Control

Tech Stack: Next.js 16 (App Router, Turbopack) · React 19 · TypeScript ·
Supabase (Auth/DB/Storage/Edge Functions/pgvector) · Vercel · Custom CSS

