KEY BEHAVIORS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Task lifecycle: pending_approval → todo → in_progress → in_review → complete

Auto-flag at 30% time remaining + system note + manager notification

Unassigned tasks cannot start (UI blocked)

Time estimate approval required before work begins (chair/cochair only)

Kenyan payroll: PAYE bands 2025, NSSF 6%, SHIF 2.75%, Housing Levy 1.5%,
Personal relief KSh 2,400

Notifications: in-app bell + optional email, mark read/unread

Client portal is read-only for invoices/docs, chat is bidirectional

Every "coming soon" feature has a modal explaining what's coming

