═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
DESIGN DECISIONS WORTH REMEMBERING
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Hybrid routing: frequently-used pages (dashboard/tasks/projects) live
inside /team, everything else gets its own route for shareability

All integrations are behind stubs — no UI breaks when off

Coming soon is a first-class state, not a lie: every unbuilt feature has
a modal explaining what it does and when it's coming

Every module has its own EmptyState with a sprout illustration

Client portal is client-safe: RLS ensures they see only their rows

Kenyan payroll tax logic is inline, easy to update when KRA changes rates

Notifications are event-driven (insert on action) + email via edge function

AgriMind uses pgvector 1536-dim (OpenAI text-embedding-3-small)

Full RLS on every table, security-definer helpers prevent recursion

